<title>UK: J.P. Morgan sets calls on a retail stocks basket.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan sets calls on a retail stocks basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Jersey has issued 100,000 American-style call warrants, on a basket of retail stocks, lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities said.</p>
<p>The equally weighted basket includes shares of Koninklijke Ahold, De Boer Winkelbedrijven, Ets Economiques du Casino Guichard-Perrachon &amp; Cie, Ets Delhaize Freres et Cie LE LION' SA, Rinascente and Kingfisher Plc.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1000 ECU		  ISSUE PRICE  239 ECU</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	24.APR.00		 PAYDATE	23.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN TRADE    1000</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT CONTROLS 1,000 ECU NOTIONAL.  NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE    JPMED09</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
